n. v2.3.1 is unhealthy in production. The first attempt halted after us-east with an orchestrator error, leaving the service mixed across regions. I retried once, and the rollback completed in us-east, us-west and eu-west.\n- **Incident:** SEV2 incident INC-0001 is open for checkout-api. The first create call timed out, but the incident had been created, so I did not open a duplicate. It describes the rollback, the partial failure and the retry, and the follow-ups.\n\nFollow-ups for the team: find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failure, look into the orchestrator partial failure, and decide on the fix before v2.3.1 is redeployed. Redeploying v2.3.1 is not in scope here, and it would need change-manager approval because it has never been healthy in production.", "type": "text"}]}]}